                <pb facs="0082" n="10" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg10"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 534/17.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Stutesman to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">La
                            Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-07-21"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">July 21, 1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Reports recall of Argentine minister, and says he is asked to take Chargé of
                    Argentine legation, to which Bolivian Government consents.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
